{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02Y4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$F : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$1$", "MATH_0007": "$G : \\mathcal{C}/U \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0008": "$1$", "MATH_0009": "$$\n(\\mathcal{C}/U) \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{C}/U\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-prepare-representable-map-stack-in-groupoids}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f93429e682bfc04a4f30a1bc7dc71aacd6fcd855445b56f209829587b0256b0a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3d0eb8e453dba488307e5dec4073e134c604a7343556dbb3e53bfd1da81c08da", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category.\nLet <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> be categories fibred in groupoids\nover <MATH_0004>.\nLet <MATH_0005> be a <MATH_0006>-morphism.\nLet <MATH_0007> be a <MATH_0008>-morphism.\nThen\n<MATH_0009>\nis a category fibred in groupoids.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e4acfcb32398d1dfefde02aae6f9df653bf3c77c73fea40049ee43b561460271", "unit_id": "tag:02Y6:statement"}
{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02Y4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n(\\mathcal{C}/U) \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{C}/U\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{C}\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-2-product-fibred-categories}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-cute-groupoids}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2a2f4ef1838cd767f33a1b222b645564ced0f1f25701884d39d8a4d224879ddc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ba3c1912bca0188663d42cdfa692483f03bd03e18ec8d568ae54c66bf1456ba8", "source_text": "We have already seen in Lemma <REF_0001>\nthat the composition\n<MATH_0001>\nis a category fibred in groupoids. Then the lemma follows from\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b6b1d2b77cf471b5269035494714900ef02fe7819bfb65afdbe501e454ca7ebf", "unit_id": "tag:02Y6:proof"}
